<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Employee Birthday Today</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #597BE8 0%, #3961E4 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 24px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
        }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; }
        .body {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #E9EAEB;
            border-top: none;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;
        }
        .footer { color: #7782AE; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>🎂 Employee Birthday Today</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
        <p>Dear HR Team,</p>
        <p>Today is <strong><%= employeeName %></strong>'s birthday.</p>
        <p>Consider reaching out to help celebrate their day!</p>
        <p>Regards,<br>OTS HRM System</p>
    </div>
    <p class="footer">This is an automated message, please do not reply.</p>
</body>
</html>
